FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}On peut dire que vous savez vous
faire désirer !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vous en avez mis un
temps, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Wisst ihr eigentlich, wie spät es ist?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hab mir hier die Beine in den
Bauch gestanden!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu dois avoir quelque chose de très
important à me dire pour me faire
venir jusque chez toi, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Avrai qualcosa di molto importante
da dirmi, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Altrimenti
perché mi avresti fatta venire qui?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Du musst aber ein sehr wichtiges
Anliegen haben, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} Weshalb
lässt du sonst nach mir schicken?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Konuşmak istediğine göre çok önemli
bir mesele olmalı, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Yoksa beni neden buraya çağıracaktın? {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Now, what was so important that
we had to talk about it in person,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Dis-moi, qu'y a-t-il de si important
pour que tu veuilles me faire venir
ici, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Dimmi, qual è il motivo per cui
hai voluto vedermi di persona,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Was gibt es denn so Dringendes,
das meine Präsenz erfordert,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Peki, yüz yüze konuşmamızı gerektirecek
kadar önemli olan neydi,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}The other day I was cleaning,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} and
this turned up. {{TAG:0003:0001:}}I borrowed it from
you, didn't I, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?
Here. Let me return it to you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}El otro día, limpiando un poco
en casa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} me encontré con esto.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
¿Es tuyo, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?
Toma, te lo devuelvo y tan
contentos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Geçen gün temizlik yaparken{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bu çıktı
karşıma. {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Senden ödünç almıştım, değil
mi, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?
Al. Sana geri vereyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}So remember that thing you were
saying you wanted, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I stumbled across one and bought it
for you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}A ver, ¿recuerdas esa cosa que
decías que querías, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pues resulta que la he encontrado
por ahí y te la he comprado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ti ricordi di quell'oggetto che mi
avevi chiesto, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ne ho trovato uno per caso e l'ho
comprato per te,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Hani istediğini söylediğin şu şey vardı
ya, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Şansıma bir tane buldum,
ben de senin için aldım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}I was walking around the other day,
and I found this on the ground.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Don't know why, but I kinda thought
it might be yours.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, is it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}El otro día salí a dar una vuelta
y me encontré esto en el suelo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}No sabría decir exactamente por
qué, pero he supuesto que es tuyo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
¿He acertado o no,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ieri mentre stavo passeggiando
ho trovato questo oggetto.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Non so perché ma ho pensato che
potesse essere tuo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}È così,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Vorhin bin ich beim Spaziergang
über das hier gestolpert.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hast du das etwa liegen lassen?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Zum Glück hab ich mir nicht
wehgetan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Geçen gün dolaşırken bunu yerde
buldum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Neden bilmem ama sana ait
olabilir diye düşündüm.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ee, senin mi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}You know that book you lent me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I couldn't make it all the way to
the end, so I wanted to give it back.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}There were all these words in it
that I couldn't understand.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} It was
a pretty dense read, all in all.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}¿Recuerdas el libro que me dejaste?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No voy a conseguir acabar de
leerlo, así que te lo devuelvo.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tenía todas esas palabrejas raras,
y no entendí un pimiento.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Es un
libro demasiado complejo para mí.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Sai quel libro che mi avevi prestato?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Visto che non sono riuscito a finirlo,
ho pensato di restituirtelo.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}C'erano un sacco di paroloni.
Ma perché non ci mettono un po' di
figure?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Che mattone!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Hani bana ödünç verdiğin kitap vardı ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sonuna kadar gelemedim, o yüzden geri
vermek istedim.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}İçinde anlamadığım o kadar çok kelime
vardı ki.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Baştan sona epey ağır
bir kitaptı.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Me estás tomando el pelo, ¿verdad?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Cómo me haces venir por algo así?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Soy una persona muy ocupada!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Pero ya que estoy aquí haré lo
que me pides.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
¿Listo?
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000C:}}¡Arriba!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Arriba!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡ARRIBAA!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Hala.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Si eso no te despierta,
nada lo hará.

Será mejor que me vaya, aún
tengo cosas que hacer.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}gracias por tu tiempo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Me ha encantado hablar contigo.

IT:
Beh, farei meglio ad andare ora.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ho il bucato da stendere.
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}Grazie per l'aiuto, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}È stata una giornata movimentata.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}A presto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
Lo siento, pero tengo que irme.
{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} te agradezco que me
acompañaras. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ha sido divertido.
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}No te vayas hasta que {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
te dé algo por las molestias.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Adiós!

DE:
Ich fürchte, ich muss mich
langsam auf den Weg machen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}
Danke für das Geleit, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ich hoffe, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} wird sich für
deine Hilfe erkenntlich zeigen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Auf Wiedersehen!
